{"path":"regex/match_results/ready","title":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::ready","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::match_results&lt;BidirIt,Alloc&gt;::</span>ready","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/match_results/ready","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Indicates if the match results are ready (valid) or not.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> ready<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Indicates if the match results are ready (valid) or not.\n</p><p>A default-constructed match result has no result state (is not <i>ready</i>), and can only be made ready by one of the regex algorithms. The <i>ready</i> state implies that all match results have been fully established.\n</p><p>The result of calling most member functions of the <code>match_results</code> object that is not <i>ready</i> is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the match results are ready, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;regex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> target<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"big-red-cat\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2027\">std::<span class=\"me2\">smatch</span></span></a> sm<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Default constructed smatch is \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>sm.<span class=\"me1\">ready</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"ready.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"not ready.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex</span></span></a> re1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\".*-red-.*\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/regex_search\"><span class=\"kw2030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_search</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>target, sm, re1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After search, smatch is \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>sm.<span class=\"me1\">ready</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"ready.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"not ready.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Default constructed smatch is not ready.\nAfter search, smatch is ready.</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/match_results","title":"std::match_results"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::ready","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Indicates if the match results are ready (valid) or not."},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the match results are ready, false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":138,"codeBlockCount":2}
